{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 9, :comments ["<b>Let the waters be gathered.</b> This is the completion of the work of the second day. And the raqia was not made until the drying of the earth. And do not wonder about 'and it was evening and it was morning, a second day' — for such is the sequence of <b>let the waters be gathered</b>: before there was evening and morning of the second day, Elohim said, <b>let the waters be gathered.</b> And there are many parallels to this sequence in the Torah. And the gathering of something scattered and the revealing of something hidden — this is not creation."], :book :genesis, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 1, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T23:19:01.857249268Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}